    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" caput="1" para="true">DISPVTATIO VNICA.</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2" para="true">De Motoris Primi existentia.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">NON defuere qui Deum vel esse du-</l>
    <l n="4">bitarunt, vel impijssimè negarunt,</l>
    <l n="5">quemadmodum Protagoras, Theodorus,</l>
    <l n="6">&amp; alij, vt refert Cic. 1. de natur. Deor. &amp;</l>
    <l n="7">Plut. 1. de placit Phil. vnde Atheistarum,</l>
    <l n="8">nempe sine Deo, infamem retulere appel-</l>
    <l n="9">lationem. Hisce accedunt plurimi hæretici</l>
    <l n="10">nostri temporis, &amp; maximè illi, qui</l>
    <l n="11">animam rationalem vnà cum homi-</l>
    <l n="12">ne interire putant. Contra hos,</l>
    <l n="13">qui humanam, diuinamq;</l>
    <l n="14">fidem planè contem-</l>
    <l n="15">nunt, euidentis-</l>
    <l n="16">simè insurgit</l>
    <l n="17">natura-</l>
    <l n="18">lis</l>
    <l n="19">philosophia, quæ per mo-</l>
    <l n="20">tum à posteriori, Mo-</l>
    <l n="21">toris Primi exi-</l>
    <l n="22">stentiam ve-</l>
    <l n="23">stigat. sit</l>
    <l n="24">ergo. (✠)</l>
